      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "今天是星期六，天气很热。",
      "traditional": "今天是星期六，天氣很熱。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì xīng qī liù tiān qì hěn rè",
      "english": "Today was Saturday. It was very hot."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "我有朋友了，我的朋友叫饭饭。他喜欢吃东西，也喜欢睡觉。",
      "traditional": "我有朋友了，我的朋友叫飯飯。他喜歡吃東西，也喜歡睡覺。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yǒu péng you le wǒ de péng you jiào fàn fàn tā xǐ huan chī dōng xi yě xǐ huan shuì jiào",
      "english": "I had a friend now. My friend was called Fanfan. He liked to eat and also liked to sleep."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "星期一、星期二、星期三、星期四、星期五，有人来学校，学校有饭。",
      "traditional": "星期一、星期二、星期三、星期四、星期五，有人來學校，學校有飯。",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī yī xīng qī èr xīng qī sān xīng qī sì xīng qī wǔ yǒu rén lái xué xiào xué xiào yǒu fàn",
      "english": "On Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday, and Friday, people came to the school, so there was food at the school."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "我们在学校吃饭。",
      "traditional": "我們在學校吃飯。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men zài xué xiào chī fàn",
      "english": "We ate at the school."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "星期六和星期天，没有人来学校，学校没有饭。",
      "traditional": "星期六和星期天，沒有人來學校，學校沒有飯。",
      "pinyin": "xīng qī liù hé xīng qī tiān méi yǒu rén lái xué xiào xué xiào méi yǒu fàn",
      "english": "On Saturday and Sunday, nobody came to the school, so there was no food at the school."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "我们去商店、饭店、医院找东西，吃东西。",
      "traditional": "我們去商店、飯店、醫院找東西，吃東西。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men qù shāng diàn fàn diàn yī yuàn zhǎo dōng xi chī dōng xi",
      "english": "We went to the store, the restaurant, and the hospital to look for food to eat."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "我们一起吃东西，一起睡觉，一起玩，我喜欢这个朋友！",
      "traditional": "我們一起吃東西，一起睡覺，一起玩，我喜歡這個朋友！",
      "pinyin": "wǒ men yì qǐ chī dōng xi yì qǐ shuì jiào yì qǐ wán wǒ xǐ huan zhè ge péng you",
      "english": "We ate together, slept together, and played together. I liked this friend!"
    },
    {
